 `app_state` and `sync_trigger` are sent only with sync uploads. Together they show whether background sync works on users' devices. The values come from the client, so treat them as diagnostics, not as trusted data.
 
+## Upgrading the SDK
+
+Some SDK releases need a minimum Open Wearables version, for example when they add a data type or change how a value is sent. Before upgrading the SDK in your app, read its changelog for a required Open Wearables version and upgrade Open Wearables first. An older backend may drop data from a newer SDK or store it incorrectly, and a later backend upgrade does not fix data already stored.
+
+- [iOS SDK changelog](https://github.com/the-momentum/open_wearables_ios_sdk/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md)
+- [Android SDK changelog](https://github.com/the-momentum/open_wearables_android_sdk/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)
